 defense mechanisms (PubMed:32925902). Regulates development processes such as the formation of leaf pavement cells, leaf expansion, fertility and flowering (PubMed:20149132, PubMed:20840782, PubMed:23609044). Prevents FLC accumulation to control flowering (PubMed:23976921). Modulates stomatal development by regulating the methylation-mediated silencing of ERECTA receptor genes (e.g. ER, ERL1 and ERL2) and preventing cell divisions (PubMed:27697902).	147	97	105.0	2.35e-26	41.497	Arabidopsis thaliana
